# EmailJS Configuration
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> get Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template -> get Template ID
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account -> API Keys
